{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36985","headline":"淮南送工部卢员外赴阙 · 罗隐","name":"淮南送工部卢员外赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"始从豸角曳长裾，又吐鸡香奏玉除。\n隋邸旧僚推谢掾，汉廷高议得相如。\n贵分赤笔升兰署，荣着绯衣从板舆。\n遥想到时秋欲尽，禁城凉冷露槐疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}